 "remarks": "Versatile Investment Opportunity in the Heart of Norwalk! This unique property offers the flexibility of a single-family home with a layout that functions much like a two-family residence, making it ideal for owner-occupants, multigenerational living, or savvy investors seeking additional income potential. Featuring multiple living areas, separate entrances, and a functional floor plan, the possibilities are endless for those looking to maximize value and usability. The home offers approximately 1,284 square feet of living space with 3 bedrooms, 2 full bathrooms, and a full basement for additional storage or future expansion. Conveniently located in Norwalk's Spring Hill neighborhood, you'll enjoy easy access to major highways, shopping, dining, public transportation, and everything Fairfield County has to offer. Whether you're looking for a primary residence with built-in flexibility, a potential house-hack opportunity, or an investment property in a strong rental market, this home delivers exceptional value and upside. Bring your vision and unlock the full potential of this versatile Norwalk property.",
